# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
*.out

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

plexams.yaml
# The real name of the local config is the dotfile -- "plexams.yaml" above does
# not match it. It holds secrets.key, the ZPA password and the SMTP credentials.
.plexams.yaml
*.pdf

plan*.json

Sammellisten/

# Binary from the documented build (go build -o plexams.go .): it lands in the
# repo root with a .go suffix, so every later go build/vet/lint tries to parse it
# as source and fails with "illegal character U+007F".
/plexams.go
